+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# RunLocalMechanicLedger (scoped: docs/research-notes/arc-agi3-run-local-cross-game-adaptation-
+# scope-2026-07-12.md; operator ruling recorded there clears the "is this memorization" question).
